flowchart LR
    Source[KB source] --> Document[Document]
    Document --> Job[Ingest job]
    Job --> Claim[Claim job]
    Claim --> Chunk[Split into overlapping chunks]
    Chunk --> Embed[Batch embeddings]
    Embed --> Store[Persist chunks + vectors]
    Store --> Ask[User question]
    Ask --> Retrieve[FTS + vector retrieval]
    Retrieve --> Fuse[Rank fusion]
    Fuse --> Answer[Grounded answer]
    Answer --> Cite[Citations + next actions]
    Cite --> Log[Query log]
